{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0091-s003", "text": "Målet är att stödja skolans och hemmets fostringsarbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0091-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.284942626953125, "generation_seconds": 24.480355644132942, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0091-s004", "text": "Inom verksamheten leker man, äter mellanmål och gör läxor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0091-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.34906005859375, "generation_seconds": 24.546812681946903, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0091-s005", "text": "Barnen får ofta också kompisar där.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0091-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.29803466796875, "generation_seconds": 17.36881375592202, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0092-s001", "text": "Många skolor ordnar klubbar efter skoldagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0092-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.26629638671875, "generation_seconds": 18.854223997099325, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0092-s002", "text": "Klubbarna är verksamhet utanför lektionstid som ger eleverna möjlighet att prova på olika hobbyer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0092-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.28704833984375, "generation_seconds": 29.715884131845087, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0092-s003", "text": "Alla barn kan delta i klubbverksamheten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0092-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.587188720703125, "generation_seconds": 17.203392483992502, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0092-s004", "text": "Klubbarna är frivilliga och kan vara motions-, konst- eller musikklubbar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0092-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.308074951171875, "generation_seconds": 26.387659205123782, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0093-s001", "text": "När ett barn flyttar till Finland placeras hen i en årskurs inom den grundläggande utbildningen utifrån sin ålder och vilka kunskaper och färdigheter hen har.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025955416084+0000-14/hb-c08-u0093-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.096054421768708, "peak": 0.310791015625, "generation_seconds": 47.00312846619636, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
